  "title": "08 · Only the chosen company can receive (and one scan updates all items)",
  "description": "Sign in as a retailer the carton was **not** sent to and scan it: 'This belongs to another company's shipment.'\nSign in as the right company and scan it: the Receive button appears, and all items inside move with it.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "How to show it",
      "description": "## Only the chosen company can receive (and one scan updates all items)\n\n**How to show it in the app**\n\nSign in as a retailer the carton was **not** sent to and scan it: 'This belongs to another company's shipment.'\nSign in as the right company and scan it: the Receive button appears, and all items inside move with it."
    },
    {
