        }
      },
      "title": "Other companies can't even see the shipment",
      "description": "### Other companies can't even see the shipment\n\n**DSA topic:** 6. Tree + DFS\n\nA company sees a unit only if it is involved: it holds it, the shipment is addressed to it, or it appears in the history. Everyone else gets only the id."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/components/ScanAct.tsx",
      "selection": {
