          "line": 59,
          "character": 1
        },
        "end": {
          "line": 59,
          "character": 79
        }
      },
      "title": "The Receive button shows only for the destination",
      "description": "### The Receive button shows only for the destination\n\nThe button appears only when the shipment's destination is the company that is signed in."
    },
    {
      "file": "server/app.ts",
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 498,
          "character": 1
        },
        "end": {
          "line": 501,
          "character": 8
        }
      },
      "title": "The server enforces it, and reports attempts",
      "description": "### The server enforces it, and reports attempts\n\n**DSA topic:** 9. Binary heap (priority queue)\n\nEven if someone calls the API directly, the server refuses with 403 and raises a severity-4 'diverted' alert."
    },
    {
      "file": "server/logic.ts",
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 46,
          "character": 1
        },
        "end": {
          "line": 66,
          "character": 2
        }
      },
      "title": "One carton scan updates every item: DFS of the packaging tree",
      "description": "### One carton scan updates every item: DFS of the packaging tree\n\n**DSA topic:** 6. Tree + DFS\n\nItems don't need their own scan. Their holder is the holder of their **top container** (`topOf` walks up parent pointers). `subtree` collects every carton and item below a pallet with an iterative **DFS**."
    },
    {
      "file": "shared/dsa/tree.ts",
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 4,
          "character": 1
        },
        "end": {
          "line": 14,
          "character": 2
        }
      },
      "title": "Depth-first search with a stack",
      "description": "### Depth-first search with a stack\n\n**DSA topic:** 6. Tree + DFS\n\nPop a unit, record it, push its children. Every unit below the root is visited once: O(n)."
    },
    {
      "file": "server/app.ts",
      "selection": {
