        }
      },
      "title": "Every item's last location is updated",
      "description": "### Every item's last location is updated\n\n**DSA topic:** 6. Tree + DFS, 3. Hash map / hash set\n\nThe location of this carton scan is copied to every unit inside it, so clone detection works for each item too."
    }
